<title>USA: IFS banking software installed in Moscow.</title>
<headline>IFS banking software installed in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, N.Y. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IFS International Inc said Thursday its electronic funds transfer software, known as TPII, was installed at the Moscow Bank of the Savings Bank of the Russian Federation.</p>
<p>In a statement, IFS said the system was installed by its partner, The Banking Production Center, a Russian based retail banking computer systems integrator.</p>
